  "html": "<section style=\"margin:0 auto;padding:8px 2px 24px;background-color:#fbf7ef;color:#2f3a2f;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,sans-serif\">\n  <div style=\"padding:18px 18px 16px;background-color:#f3ead9;border-left:3px solid #b08a4f;border-radius:2px 10px 10px 2px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#3a4436\">【虚构排版测试样例】秋日午后，同学们带着观察册来到校园。树叶、光影与微风，成为大家共同记录的主题。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:22px 18px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#2f3a2f\">有人蹲下观察落叶的纹理，有人画下枝头的轮廓，也有人把身边的发现写成一句短诗。大家用不同的方式，留下各自眼中的秋天。</p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:22px 18px 0\">\n    <img style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px\" src=\"asset:img1\"/>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:24px 18px 0;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #d9cbb2;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbb2;text-align:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8a6a3b;font-style:italic\">留下各自眼中的秋天</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:24px 18px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#2f3a2f\">分享时，观察册在同学们手中传阅。每个人的小小发现汇在一起，组成了这一页共同的校园记忆。</p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:26px 18px 0;text-align:center\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#c9b48f\"></span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#b08a4f;letter-spacing:2px\">·</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#c9b48f\"></span>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "rawHtml": "<section style=\"max-width:390px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 2px 24px;background-color:#fbf7ef;color:#2f3a2f;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"padding:18px 18px 16px;background-color:#f3ead9;border-left:3px solid #b08a4f;border-radius:2px 10px 10px 2px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#3a4436;\">{{p1}}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:22px 18px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#2f3a2f;\">{{p2}}</p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:22px 18px 0;\">\n    <img src=\"asset:img1\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(80,66,40,0.12);\"/>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:24px 18px 0;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #d9cbb2;border-bottom:1px solid #d9cbb2;text-align:center;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8a6a3b;font-style:italic;\">{{s:留下各自眼中的秋天}}</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:24px 18px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#2f3a2f;\">{{p3}}</p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:26px 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#c9b48f;vertical-align:middle;\"></span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#b08a4f;letter-spacing:2px;vertical-align:middle;\">·</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#c9b48f;vertical-align:middle;\"></span>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "designPlan": "文章是校园秋日观察活动的记录，语气温和、轻盈，带有手账/观察册的质感。视觉上采用暖米色底与深墨绿文字，营造秋日纸张感；正文17px、行高1.9，段间留白充足。首段作为导读，用浅暖色块和左侧细线强调，形成进入感。图片置于第二段之后，无框、圆角小阴影，像贴在观察册上的一枚照片，图注留空不显示。摘句仅取“留下各自眼中的秋天”作为轻量装饰性引句，置于图片与第三段之间，用斜体与细线分隔，控制装饰密度。整体单列、克制、有纸张呼吸感。",
  "summary": "以暖米色纸张底与墨绿文字营造秋日观察册的温和气质，首段导读色块、无框圆角配图和一处原文摘句形成清晰而不过度的阅读节奏。"
}
